00:17:32.920 --> 00:17:34.560
And I thought that's how it worked.

345
00:17:34.940 --> 00:17:35.340
Yeah.

346
00:17:36.220 --> 00:17:42.940
And when I went on other jobs, part of your job is you go in a studio every week and you

