00:19:25.960 --> 00:19:30.280
Our main guys that were with us on the stage were Ben Patrick.

377
00:19:31.340 --> 00:19:31.860
Yep.

378
00:19:31.860 --> 00:19:36.500
He was our main like production sound mixer, sound editor.

379
00:19:36.900 --> 00:19:39.700
And we had our two boom operators, Nick Carbone.

380
00:19:39.900 --> 00:19:40.980
Don't get Carboned.

381
00:19:40.980 --> 00:19:42.840
Don't get Carboned.

382
00:19:43.260 --> 00:19:44.300
And Brian Whittle.

